Cell["\<\
Operation list in decreasing  precedence order: NonCommutativeMultiply (**, \
highest), Times (*, Space), RightContract (\[RightContract]), LeftContract (\
\[LeftContract]), InnerProduct (\[InnerProduct]), CommutativeProduct (\
\[CommutativeProduct]), OuterProduct (\[OuterProduct]), GeometricProduct(\
\[GeometricProduct]), Plus (lowest)\
\>", "Notes",
