Cell["\<\
Contraction is non associative operation (contrary to geometric  or outer \
products, which are associative).  Right contract of three or more elements \
is understood as pairwise products with pairs starting from the beginning:\
\>", "Text",
 Editable->True,
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.954599763647778*^9, 3.9545997702428703`*^9}, {
